// Ayu Terminal Dark: Telegram for iOS theme, the iPhone twin of ayu-terminal-dark.palette
// (Ghostty Ayu setup: bg #0B0E14, fg #E8E6DD, purple accent #D2A6FF, amber cursor #E6B450).
// Format: Telegram-iOS makePresentationTheme(data:) in
// submodules/TelegramPresentationData/Sources/PresentationThemeCoder.swift: "key: value",
// nesting by 2 spaces, colors rrggbb or aarrggbb (alpha first) or clear.
// Every key the decoder reads is set; omitted on purpose: bubble bgList (bg + gradientBg used
// instead) and bubble shadow (flat, no shadow). Keys the app does not write back on Apply
// (modal list colors, navBar clearButton*, contextMenu badge*/extractedTint) hold the values
// the decoder falls back to, so the preview matches the applied theme.
// Install: send this file to Saved Messages, tap it, then Apply.
basedOn: night
name: Ayu Terminal Dark
dark: true
